{"updated":"2026-10-20T00:02:57.331Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Helen Haines: independent MP in critical condition in Melbourne’s Alfred hospital after being struck by car in Wangaratta – follow updates. Elsewhere, ‘I don’t want to be known as a hero’: barber who rushed to help Helen Haines praised by PM. And morocco's first female prime minister caught between the king, clerics, and feminists. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Russia are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 0.5 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 0.6 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 0.3 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 54 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.0 near 186 km NW of Port-Olry, Vanuatu. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.34,0.38,0.42,0.46,0.51,0.55,0.57,0.6,0.63,0.67,0.79,0.88,1.03,1.31,1.43,1.46,1.5,1.52,1.57,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.73,1.81,1.87,1.92,1.95,2,2.04,2.08,2.11,2.17,2.22,2.26,2.3,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.54,2.6,2.67,2.74,2.86,2.95,3.06,3.09,3.13,3.16,3.22,3.25,3.31,3.4,3.48,3.53,3.59,3.62,3.67,3.71,3.76,3.81,3.83,3.85,3.9,3.92,3.95,3.97,4.02,4.06,4.14,4.2,4.27,4.32,4.38,4.42,4.47,4.52,4.54,4.6,4.71,4.87,5.04,5.64,5.7,5.78,5.85,5.92,5.96,6.03,6.06,6.14,6.2,6.25,6.33,6.41,6.5,6.68,6.75,6.82,6.86,6.92,6.98,7.04,7.08,7.13,7.17,7.21,7.27,7.33,7.5,7.65,7.83,7.86,7.92,8,8.05,8.09,8.14,8.19,8.24,8.28,8.34,8.38,8.44,8.47,8.52,8.59,8.65,8.71,8.77,8.81,8.86,8.92,9.01,9.09,9.14,9.2,9.23,9.3,9.37,9.43,9.45,9.47,9.5,9.53,9.57,9.59,9.63,9.7,9.78,9.85,9.91,9.96,10.01,10.04,10.1,10.14,10.19,10.25,10.31,10.37,10.41,10.47,10.53,10.74,10.86,10.91,10.96,10.99,11.02,11.06,11.09,11.13,11.19,11.22,11.24,11.3,11.34,11.39,11.44,11.47,11.52,11.56,11.63,1